<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dm-Crypt on Sebastian Korotkiewicz - Tech{{log}}</title><link>https://sekor.eu.org/tags/dm-crypt/</link><description>Recent content in Dm-Crypt on Sebastian Korotkiewicz - Tech{{log}}</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Mar 2018 14:32:13 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sekor.eu.org/tags/dm-crypt/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Create an encrypted file container with dm-crypt</title><link>https://sekor.eu.org/techlog/create-an-encrypted-file-container-with-dm-crypt/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Mar 2018 14:32:13 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://sekor.eu.org/techlog/create-an-encrypted-file-container-with-dm-crypt/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Create an empty file with the size of your container&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;dd &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/dev/zero bs&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;1M count&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt; of&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;~/my-container.img&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Here I’ll use a 100MB container&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Initialise the LUKS partition on the file and set the initial passphrase.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cryptsetup luksFormat ~/mycontainer&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open the container. Opening the container creates a kernel device file which can then be mounted.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cryptsetup luksOpen ~/mycontainer secret-device&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This command will prompt for the container’s passphrase and then create a device file with the name &lt;code&gt;/dev/mapper/secret-device&lt;/code&gt;. You may choose another name than “secret-device”.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>